constraint/
	Contains Master xdc file (KCU105_master.xdc).
        Contains  xdc file (kcu105_ethernet.xdc) 

edn/
	processor_edn here.

toplevel/
	Contains the top level vhdl code of the SBC

hsys/
	hsys description of SBC core to be placed in kcu105.

	It contains the processor (edn), SRAM,  serial 
	and debug uarts

        Just do ./build.sh inside this folder.

	----------
	Dependency:  AHIR V2 tools have to be installed!
	----------

hsys_dram/

	It contains processor , Dram, serial and debug uarts

        Just do ./build.sh inside this folder.

	----------
	Dependency:  AHIR V2 tools have to be installed!
	----------

vivado_synth/

	Contains bitgen tcl file and run.sh script used to generate 
	the bitfile (in this directory).
	
ip/
	Contains the required ips.

TESTS/
	Contains Dram and Ethernet tests to verify the functionality. 
	Exampls : Marches test, Dram Profiler, Ping test, etc..
	
